  "paradigm_pack_notes": "When tamed, the Feral Behemoth's name is shortened to Behemoth. It possesses extraordinarily high Strength and its HP is also high. With Strength Materials and passives, it can surpass 1500 in Strength. Its relatively linear stat growth allows the player to make use of the Behemoth at early stages of its development. Its large body makes it vulnerable to enemy area-of-effect attacks, and also makes it rather sluggish when targeting a quick enemy, causing some of its attacks to miss. Its Feral Link, Bellow, is especially useful since it restores HP and enhances all allies with Bravery, Protect, and Shell.",
